  "prefLabel": "Env-Or 501.03 Cargo Trucks at Bulk Facilities",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Or 501.03 Cargo Trucks at Bulk Facilities. The owner or operator of any cargo truck that receives gasoline from a bulk gasoline loading terminal as defined in Env-A 1202.22 or that delivers gasoline to or receives gasoline from a bulk gasoline plant as defined in Env-A 1202.23 shall comply with the vapor recovery requirements in Env-A 1217.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Or 500) #10229, eff 11-17-12; ss by #13458, eff 10-7-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-or500.html"
